## Quick Start

1. **Configure local environment variables:**
   ```sh
   cp .env.example .env
   ```
   Fill in the project-specific values in `.env`.
2. **Verify Git hooks are active:**
   ```sh
   git config --get core.hooksPath
   ```
   Expected output: `.githooks` (run `git config core.hooksPath .githooks` on fresh clones).
