## AI Workflow Shortcuts in Antigravity

- **Plan complex features:** `/plan` before editing across multiple domains.
- **Execute multi-ticket backlogs autonomously:**
  `/goal Execute the open tickets in "<Milestone/Sprint>" using the parallel-pr-orchestrator and pr-quality-gate skills.`
- **Codify corrections permanently:** `/learn` after correcting an agent mistake.
- **Keep context sharp after merging PRs:** `/compact`.

